(AudioDSPTools/dsp/ResamplingContainer/):

  ResamplingContainer.h originates from iPlug2 and is covered by iPlug2's zlib-
  style licence, reproduced in full at the top of that file.

  Dependencies/LanczosResampler.h is derived from sst-basic-blocks, which as a
  library is GPL-3.0-or-later. That file, however, carries an explicit licence
  exception from its sole author granting use "in an MIT/BSD context as well as
  a GPL3 context"; the exception is reproduced verbatim at the top of the file.
  NAMix relies on that exception, so no GPL-licensed code enters this
  distribution.

